# Project

Build a Hebrew RTL public website and custom CMS for Yael Kanievsky.

The website domain is:

`yaelifestyle.co.il`

The business is focused on nutrition coaching and connected eating.

The public website presents:

- Homepage
- About page
- Services
- Individual service pages
- Recipes
- Individual recipe pages
- Articles
- Individual article pages
- Testimonials
- Certificates
- Contact page
- Privacy policy
- Terms of use
- Custom 404 page

# Administrator

There is one administrator: Yael.

She may manage content but may not change the visual design.

No public registration and no additional roles are required.

# Brand Colors

Use these fixed colors:

- Deep green: `#3F5F47`
- Muted olive green: `#6F8E6E`
- Warm beige: `#E3C7A6`
- Soft coral: `#D98A80`

Colors, fonts, spacing, layouts and component styling are fixed in code.

# Admin Modules

The admin area includes:

- Dashboard
- Homepage
- About
- Services
- Recipes
- Articles
- Testimonials
- Certificates
- Categories
- Tags
- Media library
- Contact messages
- Central archive
- Business profile
- Site settings

# Content Statuses

Services, recipes and articles support:

- `draft`
- `published`
- `archived`

Archived items are displayed in one central archive.

From the archive, the administrator may:

- Restore as draft
- Restore and publish
- Permanently delete

Duplicated items are always created as draft.

# SEO

SEO fields are generated automatically but may be edited from a collapsed advanced section.

The project includes:

- Metadata
- Open Graph
- Canonical URLs
- Clean slugs
- Breadcrumbs
- Structured data
- Sitemap
- robots.txt
- Google Search Console
- Google Analytics 4